                "text": "Last night, I met with Western Pennsylvanians who get their healthcare through @PennieOfficial. They are some of the 22 million Americans who are facing big hikes in the cost of their health insurance premiums unless Congress acts. \n\nThey had a clear message for politicians down in Washington: help lower healthcare costs for families like theirs.",
